    "body": "### Contributing guidelines\r\n\r\n- [X] I have read [CONTRIBUTING.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md)\r\n- [X] I have read [CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md)\r\n\r\n### Module(s)\r\n\r\nfiles.mini\r\n\r\n### Description\r\n\r\nHey!,\r\n\r\nLove files.mini but i have a small style issue where a personal plugin and a theme function i have is conflicting with the border highlights constantly being set, is it possible to disable that feature or add an alternate like text color difference or an alternate way to visual a changes.\r\n\r\nThank you!\r\n\r\nNOTE: and after some though just disabling might be the simplest thing it would be very hard to represent a deleted file.",
