        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Hi! Thanks for the suggestion!\r\n\r\nUnfortunately, I don't think adding this kind of customization aligns well with 'mini.files' design.\r\n\r\nClosing as not planned.\r\n\r\n------\r\n\r\nOn this note, what kind of issues do you have because of this? Maybe I can you with this?\r\n\r\n'mini.files' changes border highlighting via 'winhighlight' window option. It doesn't modify existing highlight groups, so I can't think of a way it might interfere with theming.",
