            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "yeah that was the issue and it's fine, it doesn't overwrite the whole winhighlight just highlights for floats, anyway will keep using as is or just move to an other plugin thanks for the help!\r\n\r\nThe plugin is more a proof of concept i have been using, I will more then likely never publicly release, I'm fine with using it my self but the maintenance for it is ungodly if i need to start writing hacks for ever single plugin that doesn't agree with it.",
